                                                "sense_id": "758b2b2e-5f11-3eea-9526-52d70cc2352f",
                                                "text": "an ocean of difference"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c50e43c-cc97-4874-9c02-63f15f0e4413",
                                                "sense_id": "758b2b2e-5f11-3eea-9526-52d70cc2352f",
                                                "text": "On the present occasion, Traddles was so hemmed in by the pagoda and the guitar-case, and Dora’s flower-painting, and my writing-table, that I had serious doubts of the possibility of his using his knife and fork; but he protested, with his own good-humour, ‘Oceans of room, Copperfield! I assure you, Oceans!’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8195d518-a8d9-4411-a531-ccea3bcaa4c7",
                                                "sense_id": "758b2b2e-5f11-3eea-9526-52d70cc2352f",
                                                "text": "Poison Ivy, Lord,'ll make you itch\nYou're gonna need an ocean\nOf calamine lotion\nYou'll be scratchin' like a hound\nThe minute you start to mess around"
                                            }
